# The generated catalogs are compared byte for byte with the exporters' LF output
# (tests/test_application_registry.py::test_committed_catalog_json_is_current and
# tests/test_commercial_offer_catalog.py::TestExports::test_committed_commercial_catalog_json_is_current).
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes them as CRLF and
# both tests fail on a tree that matches the repository exactly.
adaptix_contracts/application_catalog.json text eol=lf
adaptix_contracts/commercial_catalog.json text eol=lf
